  data: {
    LLM: "1. Bidding: players bid 1-4 (or pass). 2. High bidder names trump and calls for partner (e.g. 'Ace of spades'). Holder of that card is partner (doesn't reveal until card played). 3. Play as Pitch: follow suit, trump. 4. Score high, low, jack, game for the bidding team.",
